  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A Blueprint Book unlocks higher-tier recipes (like iron) once you''ve
    crafted enough of the current tier and have enough gold.

    Each level runs
    for a set number of days. When the day limit is hit, you get a scorecard showing
    weapons made, gold earned, time taken, and a star rating (0-5). Passing the level
    (enough stars + enough gold) unlocks the next one.

    Your leftover gold at
    the end of a level gets banked - that''s what carries over to spend on the skill
    tree back in the Hub.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
