  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The Skill Tree

    Three columns of unlockable upgrades, bought with
    banked gold (the gold you''ve earned and kept from previous runs - shown on screen
    in the Hub).

    Each column must be unlocked top to bottom - you need the one
    above before you can buy the one below it.

    Left column - Technique: weapons
    sell for more money.

    Middle column - Efficiency: the furnace can smelt more
    things at once, and all crafting stations work faster.

    Right column - Multitask:
    once unlocked, holding left-click works every station in the workshop at the
    same time, instead of only the one you''re looking at.

    The Workshop (Main
    Game Loop)


    This is a separate scene - it''s where an actual "run" of a
    level happens, and where most of the game is played.


    The workshop runs
    on a day/night cycle.

    At night, a seller shows up - buy raw materials (ore,
    etc.) from their shop.

    During the day, customers show up wanting weapons
    - hand them the item they''re asking for to sell it and earn gold.

    In between,
    you craft:

    Furnace - smelt ore into ingots. Some ingots need a specific
    mold placed in the furnace first.

    Anvil - forge an ingot into a blade (hold
    left-click to stretch it into shape).

    Grinder - sharpen a blade into a finished
    blade edge (hold left-click again).

    Merge Table - assemble the final weapon
    by placing all its parts (blade, guard, grip, etc.) together.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
