      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Forged - Tester Guide

    Controls

    Left-click - interact with anything
    you''re looking at (pick things up, use stations, click UI buttons)

    Right-click
    - drop whatever you''re currently holding

    B - toggle Build Mode (place/move
    objects; Q/E rotates)

    You can only carry one item at a time.

    The Main
    Hub


    This is the scene you start in and return to between runs. Two things
    live here:


    The Map

    A wall of level nodes (cubes), one per level.

    Nodes
    are colored red (not passed yet) or green (already passed).

    Click a node
    once to select it - a preview panel pops up showing that level''s name, requirements,
    and your best result so far.

    Click the same node again to actually load
    into that level (this takes you to the Workshop scene).

    Clicking a different
    node instead just switches the preview - it won''t load anything until you click
    that same one twice.

    Press Escape or right-click to back out of the map
    and return to free movement.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
